	017	018	262.0	8.00	-9.0	-8.8	
	018	019	320.0	8.00	-8.8	-9.0	
	019	020	330.0	3.50	-9.0	-9.0	;End of G2
*end G2

*begin ContinentalDrift
	*export 020 024
	*date 2010.05.06
	*calibrate declination +2.59

	*data diving from to bearing length fromdepth todepth
